Sun Nov 08 12:52:34 UTC 2026 - Gakuto Furuya <g.furuya@gaato.net>

- Update to version 1.12.0:
  * Reject unsafe repository URL paths
  * Process all repository arguments in ghq rm
  * Avoid data races in parallel ghq get operations
  * Avoid panics for inaccessible repository roots
  * Reject unknown --vcs values
  * Use the primary root with multiple GHQ_ROOT entries
  * Synchronize submodule URLs before updating and descending
  * Clarify URL-specific configuration
  * Update Go dependencies (urfave/cli/v3 3.14.0 and golang.org/x/*)
- Use the distribution Go toolchain without automatic downloads
  during build and tests.

